*% ── 以下配置存在 Mac 侧 PPD 里，CUPS 每次作业都会传给驱动 ──
*% 打印机掉电、重启、换纸都不会丢；改这里等于改这台机器以后每次打印的默认值
*OpenUI *DeliDpi/DeliDpi: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliDpi
*DefaultDeliDpi: 300
*DeliDpi 300/dots per inch: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliDpi
*OpenUI *DeliSizeW/DeliSizeW: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliSizeW
*DefaultDeliSizeW: 100.0
*DeliSizeW 100.0/物理宽度 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliSizeW
*OpenUI *DeliSizeH/DeliSizeH: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliSizeH
*DefaultDeliSizeH: 100
*DeliSizeH 100/物理高度 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliSizeH
*OpenUI *DeliGap/DeliGap: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliGap
*DefaultDeliGap: 2.0
*DeliGap 2.0/标签间隙 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliGap
*OpenUI *DeliDensity/DeliDensity: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliDensity
*DefaultDeliDensity: 8
*DeliDensity 8/浓度 0-15: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliDensity
*OpenUI *DeliSpeed/DeliSpeed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliSpeed
*DefaultDeliSpeed: 4
*DeliSpeed 4/速度: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliSpeed
*OpenUI *DeliDirection/DeliDirection: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliDirection
*DefaultDeliDirection: 1
*DeliDirection 1/走纸方向: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliDirection
*OpenUI *DeliRotate180/DeliRotate180: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliRotate180
*DefaultDeliRotate180: 1
*DeliRotate180 1/旋转 180 度: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliRotate180
*OpenUI *DeliInvert/DeliInvert: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliInvert
*DefaultDeliInvert: 1
*DeliInvert 1/位图极性: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliInvert
*OpenUI *DeliTearOff/DeliTearOff: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliTearOff
*DefaultDeliTearOff: 1
*DeliTearOff 1/走纸到撕纸位: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliTearOff
*OpenUI *DeliOffsetY/DeliOffsetY: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliOffsetY
*DefaultDeliOffsetY: 0
*DeliOffsetY 0/纵向微调 dot: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliOffsetY

*OpenUI *PBPdl/指令集: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PBPdl
*DefaultPBPdl: tspl
*PBPdl tspl/tspl: ""
*PBPdl zpl/zpl: ""
*PBPdl escpos/escpos: ""
*PBPdl passthrough/passthrough: ""
*CloseUI: *PBPdl

*OpenUI *PBMediaType/介质类型: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PBMediaType
*DefaultPBMediaType: gap
*PBMediaType gap/gap: ""
*PBMediaType blackmark/blackmark: ""
*PBMediaType continuous/continuous: ""
*CloseUI: *PBMediaType

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.001)" Standard ROM

*% 纸型总数：52
